.TH WERKMEISTER-STATS 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-stats \- Show Docker container resource usage (CPU, memory)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister stats\fR
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-collect <MINUTES>\fR
Collect stats over N minutes (default: snapshot only)
.TP
\fB\-i, \-\-interval <SECS>\fR
Sampling interval in seconds (default: 10)
.TP
\fB\-\-save\fR
Save results to stats/ directory
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Shows Docker resource usage for every werkmeister container: one snapshot by default, or samples collected over a period.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
.nf
.RS 4
werkmeister stats                     # snapshot of current usage
werkmeister stats \-\-collect 5         # collect for 5 minutes
werkmeister stats \-\-collect 30 \-i 5   # 30 minutes, 5\-second intervals
.RE
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBwerkmeister optimize\fR compares the same numbers with the configured limits.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
